  <metadata>
    <name>Cross Kirkland Corridor: South Kirkland to Totem Lake (5.8 mi)</name>
    <desc>Cross Kirkland Corridor (part of Eastrail), Kirkland, WA, northbound. Flat former rail grade. Trail geometry: OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), CKC ways plus the Totem Lake Connector bridge. Elevation: AWS Terrain Tiles (Terrarium, z15), smoothed.</desc>
